# jOTi (joy OT infrastructure) Lab

A practical laboratory to learn OT Networking, Cybersecurity, commissioning and troubleshooting.

## Scope

- 2 IP subnets connected through a Linux router/firewall.
- 1 Modbus TCP server
- 1 authorized client
- 1 UNauthorized client.
- Packet captures.
- Routing table.
- firewall evidence.
- Reversible faults inbolving firewall rules and return routes.

## Status

Planning and environmen preparation.
No infrastructure yet.